    "html": "<p id='6' data-category='paragraph' style='font-size:16px'>Bitumen cargo values gained across Europe and Asia-Pacific,<br>boosted by a jump in crude and fuel oil values.</p>",
    "text": "Bitumen cargo values gained across Europe and Asia-Pacific,\nboosted by a jump in crude and fuel oil values."
  },
  {
    "id": "87040d58-4dcf-4e76-ba41-21632f71f1b9",
