      {
        "x": 90,
        "y": 1013
      }
    ],
    "html": "<br><p id='11' data-category='paragraph' style='font-size:16px'>Demand is expected to improve from Vietnam, Australia,<br>China and India in the coming weeks supported by seasonal<br>pick-up or the easing of pandemic-related restrictions.</p>",
    "text": "Demand is expected to improve from Vietnam, Australia,\nChina and India in the coming weeks supported by seasonal\npick-up or the easing of pandemic-related restrictions."
  },
